<section class="shell band">
  <p class="eyebrow">A gentle self-care workbook</p>
  <h1>Effort-less Self-Care</h1>
  <div class="split split--aside">
    <div>
      <p class="lede">7 Easy Steps to Calm and Connection</p>
      <div class="answer">
        <p>Slow down and build a relationship with your body, your breath and your inner self.
        There is nothing here to fix. Notice yourself, be kind to yourself, stay curious.
        <strong>Healing begins when you learn to listen.</strong> Written by Reem Glasco, LPC-S,
        the workbook sets out seven short steps, each paired with watercolor imagery and
        journal prompts, to be used daily or whenever you need to reset. The workbook and the
        journal are one volume: you read a step, then write on the pages that follow it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="cta" href="/book/practice/">Try the seven steps</a>
        <a class="cta cta--quiet" href="https://www.barnesandnoble.com/w/effortless-self-care-reem-glasco/1149690519"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find it on Barnes &amp; Noble<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <img class="cover" src="/assets/img/effortless-self-care-cover.jpg" width="600" height="900"
       alt="Cover of Effort-less Self-Care by Reem Glasco, LPC-S: a watercolor armchair beside a window and a small potted plant.">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

